  "id": "monitored-store-returns",
  "title": "Stores on enhanced return monitoring",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "3b5b8fcc-b7a7-45a8-8400-672f598643e6",
      "question": "The loss-prevention memo puts three stores on enhanced return monitoring. How many returns did those stores process in Q3 2026, and what share of the chain's returned value is that?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:14:32.146462Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:14:42.864655Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "The loss-prevention memo identifies three stores on enhanced return monitoring: **S06 (Newark Gateway, Northeast)**, **S16 (Indianapolis Fashion Mall, Midwest)**, and **S22 (Los Angeles Westside, West)** [1].\n\nIn Q3 2026 (July–September), those stores processed the following returns [2]:\n\n| Store | Store Name | Region | Returns | Returned Value | Share of Chain Value |\n|-------|------------|--------|---------|----------------|----------------------|\n| S06 | Lumen Newark Gateway | Northeast | 12 | $1,134.38 | 5.67% |\n| S16 | Lumen Indianapolis Fashion Mall | Midwest | 7 | $591.13 | 2.95% |\n| S22 | Lumen Los Angeles Westside | West | 18 | $1,866.98 | 9.33% |\n| **Total (3 stores)** | | | **37** | **$3,592.49** | **17.95%** |\n\n**Chain-wide Q3 2026 totals**: 174 returns, $20,009.59 returned value.\n\n**Answer**: The three enhanced-monitoring stores processed **37 returns** in Q3 2026, accounting for **$3,592.49** in returned value—**17.95% of the chain's total returned value** that quarter.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Unstructured Retrieval evidence — 3 documents — evidence `hermes-receipt:7829f52f0c050031a182f0e940296543e048c0a7395ef3c3b46cb5c82f6ef427`\n- [2] Structured retrieval result — retail_sales — evidence `hermes-receipt:1ed10603e76a038d4980ea83cde6f1127514cd99f73264baaad2687cb1377048`",
        "citations": [
