                "sourceId": "retail.policies",
                "documentId": "retail.policies:f-17e1fb4d753ce9d2",
                "chunkId": "retail.policies:f-17e1fb4d753ce9d2:0008",
                "title": "store-operations-sop.pdf",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Store Operations Standard Operating\nProcedures\n6. Returns and exchanges at the point of sale\nReturns are governed by the Return and Refund Policy (POL-RET-014) and by any Asset Protection memo in force. The cashier’s job is to apply them consistently, record the right codes, and escalate when a rule requires approval.\nSOP-OPS-007 | Version 6.1 Internal use only. Synthetic document for a software demonstration. Page 2 of 5\nLUMEN RETAIL GROUP Store Operations Standard Operating Procedures",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "nemotron-parse-2.0",
                  "file_id": "f-17e1fb4d753ce9d2",
                  "file_name": "store-operations-sop.pdf",
                  "citation": "store-operations-sop.pdf, p. 2",
