                "title": "loss-prevention-memo.png",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "MEMORANDUM\n2. Manager approval\nA Store Manager must approve, with an override code: any return over $250.00; any Electronics return where the serial number was not captured; and a third return by the same customer within 30 days.",
                "metadata": {
